# /mcp with a project .mcp.json (trust prompt) and a profile server added by
# command. Both run fx's own e2e stdio fixture (a copy), by absolute paths.
work mcp-ws
gateway mcp-turn.json
wait 3
snap startup
key 3
wait 1
snap rejected
type /mcp list
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap list-rejected
key Escape
wait 0.3
key C-u
type /mcp add fixture /opt/homebrew/bin/bun <fixtures>/mcp-legacy-stdio.mjs
key Enter
wait 4
snap added
type /mcp
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap menu
key Down
wait 0.5
snap menu-down
key Right
wait 1
snap menu-tools
key Right
wait 1
snap menu-resources
key Right
wait 1
snap menu-prompts
key Escape
wait 0.5
wait 0.3
key C-u
type /mcp list
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap list
key Escape
wait 0.3
key C-u
type /mcp resource list fixture
key Enter
wait 2
snap resource-list
type /mcp resource read fixture legacy://alpha
key Enter
wait 2
snap resource-read
type /mcp prompt list fixture
key Enter
wait 2
snap prompt-list
type /mcp prompt get fixture review {"tone":"brief"}
key Enter
wait 2
snap prompt-get
type /mcp auth fixture
key Enter
wait 1
snap auth-stdio
type /mcp logout fixture
key Enter
wait 1
snap logout-stdio
home after-add
type what MCP tools do you have?
key Enter
wait 4
snap turn
type /mcp trust approve proj
key Enter
wait 4
snap trust-approve
type /mcp remove fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap removed
type /mcp trust reset
key Enter
wait 3
snap trust-reset
snapfull end
home end
gwlog
